    "name": "Photo Puzzles HD",
    "steam_appid": 1716160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/extras/70084c6498f2fb2834db39b56202b738.avif?t=1749195784\" /></div>-&quot;Photo Puzzles HD&quot; is a jigsaw-style puzzle game where you arrange square and rectangular pieces to complete beautiful images. The game features three exciting modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tile Swap:</strong> Click to swap square tiles into their correct positions and complete the picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tile Rotation:</strong> Click to rotate square tiles to restore the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split Tiles:</strong> Click to swap rectangular tiles into their correct spots to complete the picture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start solving puzzles today! Enjoy beautiful photos and release your stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">126 categories, 3000+ stunning HD photos (1800px x 1200px)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No downloadable content (DLCs) required; all in-game images are fully unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three different game modes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight difficulty levels: 6x4, 9x6, 12x8, 15x10, 18x12 (Normal), 18x12 (Hard), 21x14 (Normal), 21x14 (Hard).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom puzzles with your own photos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax your brain with new puzzles every two days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and classic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suitable for both kids and adults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning graphics and cute characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calming music and a peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun sound effects and a modern design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and relaxing to play, yet challenging to master.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716160/extras/70084c6498f2fb2834db39b56202b738.avif?t=1749195784\" /></div>-&quot;Photo Puzzles HD&quot; is a jigsaw-style puzzle game where you arrange square and rectangular pieces to complete beautiful images. The game features three exciting modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tile Swap:</strong> Click to swap square tiles into their correct positions and complete the picture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tile Rotation:</strong> Click to rotate square tiles to restore the image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Split Tiles:</strong> Click to swap rectangular tiles into their correct spots to complete the picture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start solving puzzles today! Enjoy beautiful photos and release your stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">126 categories, 3000+ stunning HD photos (1800px x 1200px)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No downloadable content (DLCs) required; all in-game images are fully unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three different game modes to choose from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eight difficulty levels: 6x4, 9x6, 12x8, 15x10, 18x12 (Normal), 18x12 (Hard), 21x14 (Normal), 21x14 (Hard).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create custom puzzles with your own photos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relax your brain with new puzzles every two days.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun and classic gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Suitable for both kids and adults.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning graphics and cute characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Calming music and a peaceful atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun sound effects and a modern design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy and relaxing to play, yet challenging to master.</p></li></ul>",
